ude `expected_completion_at` and timestamp fields for tracking, and am carefully checking for appropriate data types and ensuring referential integrity.\n\n\n**Defining Workflow Exceptions**\n\nI\'m now defining the `WorkflowException` model. I\'ve focused on crucial attributes like `exception_type`, `priority`, and `status`. I\'m paying attention to `affected_record_type` and `affected_record_id` for traceability, and I\'ve also incorporated timestamp fields. I\'m making sure that I have all the needed fields for the proper implementation.\n\n\n"
