  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Backend Services**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the core business services. Specifically, I\'m working on the service layer, starting with initializing the service directory and then moving to defining the specific services, including a doctor service, an appointment service, and a lab service. I\'m keen to get these foundational services in place.\n\n\n**Analyzing Service Requirements**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the requirements for each service, starting with `doctor_service.py` and `appointment_service.py`. I\'m breaking down their functionalities, focusing on the specific methods like `get_hospitals` and `search_doctors`, along with the typed Python service functions for AI tools. I am giving a careful look at the booking reliability requirements to ensure transaction safety and prevent double bookings.\n\n\n**Defining Appointment Flow**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the appointment workflow, specifically the booking, cancellation, and completion operations. Booking needs a single database transaction with a lock to ensure data integrity and avoid double bookings. Cancellation requires verification steps to prevent misuse. I\'m prioritizing data consistency and auditing, as I finalize appointment management processes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_253596"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"from datetime import datetime, timezone\\nfrom typing import Optional, List, Dict, Any\\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import Session, joinedload\\nfrom sqlalchemy import select, and_, or_\\nfrom app.models.hospital import Hospital\\nfrom app.models.department import Department\\nfrom app.models.doctor import Doctor\\nfrom app.models.appointment_slot import AppointmentSlot\\n\\n\\ndef get_hospitals(db: Session, is_active: Optional[bool] = True) -> List[Hospital]:\\n    query = select(Hospital)\\n    if is_active is not None:\\n        query = query.where(Hospital.is_active == is_active)\\n    return list(db.scalars(query).all())\\n\\n\\ndef get_hospital_by_id(db: Session, hospital_id: str) -> Optional[Hospital]:\\n    query = (\\n        select(Hospital)\\n        .options(joinedload(Hospital.departments))\\n        .where(Hospital.id == hospital_id)\\n    )\\n    return db.scalars(query).first()\\n\\n\\ndef get_doctors(\\n    db: Session,\\n    specialty: Optional[str] = None,\\n    department_id: Optional[str] = None,\\n    department_name: Optional[str] = None,\\n    hospital_id: Optional[str] = None,\\n    is_active: bool = True,\\n) -> List[Doctor]:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Retrieve doctors with flexible multi-field filtering.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    query = (\\n        select(Doctor)\\n        .join(Department, Doctor.department_id == Department.id)\\n        .options(joinedload(Doctor.department), joinedload(Doctor.hospital))\\n        .where(Doctor.is_active == is_active)\\n    )\\n\\n    if hospital_id:\\n        query = query.where(Doctor.hospital_id == hospital_id)\\n    if department_id:\\n        query = query.where(Doctor.department_id == department_id)\\n    if department_name:\\n        query = query.where(Department.name.ilike(f\\\"%{department_name}%\\\"))\\n    if specialty:\\n        query = query.where(Doctor.specialty.ilike(f\\\"%{specialty}%\\\"))\\n\\n    return list(db.scalars(query).all())\\n\\n\\ndef get_doctor_by_id(db: Session, doctor_id: str) -> Optional[Doctor]:\\n    query = (\\n        select(Doctor)\\n        .options(joinedload(Doctor.department), joinedload(Doctor.hospital))\\n        .where(Doctor.id == doctor_id)\\n    )\\n    return db.scalars(query).first()\\n\\n\\ndef get_available_slots(\\n    db: Session,\\n    doctor_id: str,\\n    start_date: Optional[datetime] = None,\\n    end_date: Optional[datetime] = None,\\n) -> List[AppointmentSlot]:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Retrieve only unreserved, available slots for a specific doctor.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    query = select(AppointmentSlot).where(\\n        AppointmentSlot.doctor_id == doctor_id,\\n        AppointmentSlot.status == \\\"AVAILABLE\\\",\\n    )\\n\\n    if start_date:\\n        query = query.where(AppointmentSlot.start_time >= start_date)\\n    if end_date:\\n        query = query.where(AppointmentSlot.start_time <= end_date)\\n\\n    query = query.order_by(AppointmentSlot.start_time.asc())\\n    return list(db.scalars(query).all())\\n\\n\\n# ==============================================================================\\n# AI Tool Interfaces (Section 9: Typed Python Service Functions)\\n# ==============================================================================\\n\\ndef search_doctors_tool(\\n    db: Session,\\n    specialty_or_department: Optional[str] = None,\\n    hospital_id: Optional[str] = None,\\n) -> List[Dict[str, Any]]:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    AI Tool: search_doctors\\n    Finds doctors matching clinical specialty or department keyword.\\n    Strictly validates input; returns structured JSON-compatible dictionary.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    query = (\\n        select(Doctor)\\n        .join(Department, Doctor.department_id == Department.id)\\n        .options(joinedload(Doctor.department))\\n        .where(Doctor.is_active == True)\\n    )\\n\\n    if hospital_id:\\n        query = query.where(Doctor.hospital_id == hospital_id)\\n\\n    if specialty_or_department:\\n        term = f\\\"%{specialty_or_department.strip()}%\\\"\\n        query = query.where(\\n            or_(\\n                Doctor.specialty.ilike(term),\\n                Department.name.ilike(term),\\n                Doctor.display_name.ilike(term),\\n            )\\n        )\\n\\n    doctors = db.scalars(query).all()\\n    results = []\\n    for doc in doctors:\\n        results.append({\\n            \\\"doctor_id\\\": doc.id,\\n            \\\"display_name\\\": doc.display_name,\\n            \\\"specialty\\\": doc.specialty,\\n            \\\"department_name\\\": doc.department.name if doc.department else \\\"General\\\",\\n            \\\"hospital_id\\\": doc.hospital_id,\\n        })\\n    return results\\n\\n\\ndef get_available_slots_tool(\\n    db: Session,\\n    doctor_id: str,\\n    requested_date: Optional[str] = None,\\n    time_range: Optional[str] = None,\\n) -> List[Dict[str, Any]]:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    AI Tool: get_available_slots\\n    Retrieves confirmed open slots for a doctor with optional date and time filtering.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    doc = get_doctor_by_id(db, doctor_id)\\n    if not doc:\\n        return []\\n\\n    query = select(AppointmentSlot).where(\\n        AppointmentSlot.doctor_id == doctor_id,\\n        AppointmentSlot.status == \\\"AVAILABLE\\\",\\n    )\\n\\n    slots = db.scalars(query.order_by(AppointmentSlot.start_time.asc())).all()\\n    results = []\\n\\n    for slot in slots:\\n        slot_dt_str = slot.start_time.strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d\\\")\\n        if requested_date and slot_dt_str != requested_date:\\n            continue\\n\\n        slot_hour = slot.start_time.hour\\n        if time_range:\\n            tr = time_range.lower()\\n            if \\\"morning\\\" in tr and not (6 <= slot_hour < 12):\\n                continue\\n            if \\\"afternoon\\\" in tr and not (12 <= slot_hour < 17):\\n                continue\\n            if \\\"evening\\\" in tr and not (17 <= slot_hour < 21):\\n                continue\\n\\n        results.append({\\n            \\\"slot_id\\\": slot.id,\\n            \\\"doctor_id\\\": doc.id,\\n            \\\"doctor_name\\\": doc.display_name,\\n            \\\"specialty\\\": doc.specialty,\\n            \\\"start_time\\\": slot.start_time.isoformat(),\\n            \\\"end_time\\\": slot.end_time.isoformat(),\\n            \\\"status\\\": slot.status,\\n        })\\n\\n    return results\\n\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/backend/app/services/doctor_service.py\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating services/doctor_service.py\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create Doctor service\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
