    thinking: "**Constructing Application Framework**\n\nI am now implementing `backend/app/main.py`. My focus is creating the FastAPI application and setting up the core functionalities. This includes the essential OpenAPI documentation at `/docs`, configuring Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS), integrating the `api_router` under `/api/v1`, and developing the root healthcheck with version and hospital status. Finally, I\'m integrating startup and shutdown handlers.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_311922"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"from fastapi import FastAPI\\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\\nfrom app.core.config import settings\\nfrom app.api.v1.router import api_router\\n\\napp = FastAPI(\\n    title=settings.PROJECT_NAME,\\n    description=(\\n        \\\"MediVoice AI - Voice-First Hospital Operations Platform for Aarogya One Hospital. \\\"\\n        \\\"Phase 1: Backend Foundation, PostgreSQL/SQLAlchemy Schemas, Transaction-Safe Slot Booking, \\\"\\n        \\\"and AI Tool Interface Readiness.\\\"\\n    ),\\n    version=\\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n    docs_url=\\\"/docs\\\",\\n    redoc_url=\\\"/redoc\\\",\\n    openapi_url=f\\\"{settings.API_V1_STR}/openapi.json\\\",\\n)\\n\\n# CORS Middleware\\nif settings.BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS:\\n    app.add_middleware(\\n        CORSMiddleware,\\n        allow_origins=settings.BACKEND_CORS_ORIGINS,\\n        allow_credentials=True,\\n        allow_methods=[\\\"*\\\"],\\n        allow_headers=[\\\"*\\\"],\\n    )\\n\\n# Include v1 API routes\\napp.include_router(api_router, prefix=settings.API_V1_STR)\\n\\n\\n@app.get(\\\"/\\\", tags=[\\\"Health\\\"])\\ndef root_health():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Healthcheck endpoint confirming backend readiness.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return {\\n        \\\"status\\\": \\\"healthy\\\",\\n        \\\"service\\\": settings.PROJECT_NAME,\\n        \\\"hospital\\\": settings.DEFAULT_HOSPITAL_NAME,\\n        \\\"phase\\\": \\\"Phase 1 - Backend Foundation & Database Design\\\",\\n        \\\"docs_url\\\": \\\"/docs\\\",\\n        \\\"api_v1\\\": settings.API_V1_STR,\\n    }\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    import uvicorn\\n    uvicorn.run(\\\"app.main:app\\\", host=\\\"0.0.0.0\\\", port=8000, reload=True)\\n\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/backend/app/main.py\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating app/main.py\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create main FastAPI application\"}"
