    thinking: "**Completing the testing**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that all twenty-six tests have passed without a hitch. My focus has now shifted to crafting detailed and robust README files for both the backend and root directories. The goal is to provide clear instructions for installation, environment configuration, database setup (covering PostgreSQL and SQLite), along with migration and seeding commands.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_186621"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"# MediVoice AI \342\200\224 Phase 1: Backend Foundation and Database Design\\n**Hospital Context:** Aarogya One Hospital (Fictional Tertiary Healthcare Center, Bengaluru)  \\n**Program:** Great Indian AI Internship Challenge  \\n**Phase Status:** Phase 1 Foundation Completed & Verified  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Architectural Overview\\n\\nMediVoice AI is designed as an enterprise, voice-first hospital operations platform. Phase 1 establishes the rock-solid transactional and relational database foundation, ensuring that future reasoning models and speech pipelines interact solely with strictly-typed, validated tool functions and never execute raw SQL or mutate database state directly.\\n\\n```\\n                           \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n                           \342\224\202   Future AI Voice Agent      \342\224\202\\n                           \342\224\202 (Gnani Prisma / Timbre / AI) \342\224\202\\n                           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                          \342\224\202\\n                  [Restricted Tool Allowlist & Schema Validation]\\n                                          \342\224\202\\n                                          \342\226\274\\n                      \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n                      \342\224\202        FastAPI REST & Tool API        \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - search_doctors                     \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - get_available_slots                \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - book_appointment (Atomic Tx)       \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                         \342\224\202\\n                         [SQLAlchemy 2.x ORM & Pydantic v2]\\n                                         \342\224\202\\n                                         \342\226\274\\n                      \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n                      \342\224\202    PostgreSQL Database (or SQLite)    \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - Hospitals / Departments            \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - Doctors / AppointmentSlots         \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - Appointments (Unique slot_id)      \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - LabOrders (Workflow metadata only) \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\202  - WorkflowExceptions & AuditEvents   \342\224\202\\n                      \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\nbackend/\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 app/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.py                     # FastAPI application entrypoint & OpenAPI /docs\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 core/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 config.py               # Pydantic Settings & environment configuration\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 db/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 base.py                 # DeclarativeBase definition\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 session.py              # Engine creation & session lifecycle dependency\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 models/                     # SQLAlchemy 2.x declarative models\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 hospital.py             # Hospital model\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 department.py           # Department model\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 doctor.py               # Doctor model\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 appointment_slot.py     # Slot availability & unique constraint\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 appointment.py          # Appointment records & unique slot constraint\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 lab_order.py            # Workflow metadata (no clinical results)\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 workflow_exception.py   # Operational exception & resolution model\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 audit_event.py          # Immutable audit logging for all actions\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 schemas/                    # Pydantic v2 request/response schemas\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 hospital.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 doctor.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 appointment.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 lab_order.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 workflow.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/                   # Business logic & AI Tool interface boundaries\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 doctor_service.py       # Doctor retrieval & AI tools\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 appointment_service.py  # Atomic booking, cancellation & completion\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 lab_service.py          # Lab order workflow metadata management\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 workflow_service.py     # Deterministic overdue order detection & resolution\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 api/\\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 v1/\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 router.py           # Aggregate v1 API router\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 hospitals.py        # /api/v1/hospitals\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 doctors.py          # /api/v1/doctors and /slots\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 appointments.py     # /api/v1/appointments, /cancel, /complete, /follow-up\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 lab_orders.py       # /api/v1/lab-orders\\n\342\224\202           \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 workflow.py         # /api/v1/workflow/exceptions, /detect, /assign, /resolve\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tests/                          # Automated Pytest suite (26 comprehensive tests)\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 conftest.py                 # TestClient & in-memory test DB fixtures\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 test_doctors.py             # Doctor query, specialty filter, slots & AI tools\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 test_appointments.py        # Atomic booking, double-booking prevention, cancellations\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 test_lab_orders.py          # Lab status updates & validations\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 test_workflow.py            # Overdue detection, assignment, resolution & audit trail\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 scripts/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 __init__.py\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 seed_data.py                # Idempotent synthetic seeding script\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 alembic/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 env.py                      # Alembic database target metadata configuration\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 script.py.mako              # Migration file template\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 versions/\\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 0001_initial_schema.py  # Production migration establishing all 8 tables\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 alembic.ini                     # Alembic configuration\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 requirements.txt                # Python dependencies\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example                    # Template environment variables\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md                       # Architecture & execution guide\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Database Schema Design\\n\\n### 3.1 Entities & Relational Guarantees\\n1. **Hospital**:\\n   - Primary key: `id` (UUID string)\\n   - `name`, `description`, `address`, `is_active`, `created_at`\\n   - Pre-seeded with **Aarogya One Hospital** in Bengaluru.\\n\\n2. **Department**:\\n   - `id`, `hospital_id` (FK -> hospitals.id, ON DELETE CASCADE)\\n   - `name`, `description`, `is_active`, `created_at`\\n   - Seeded: Cardiology, Neurology, Orthopedics, Pediatrics, General Medicine.\\n\\n3. **Doctor**:\\n   - `id`, `hospital_id`, `department_id` (FK -> departments.id)\\n   - `display_name`, `specialty`, `is_active`, `created_at`\\n   - Seeded with 6 fictional physicians across departments.\\n\\n4. **AppointmentSlot**:\\n   - `id`, `doctor_id` (FK -> doctors.id)\\n   - `start_time` (indexed), `end_time`, `status` (`AVAILABLE`, `RESERVED`, `BOOKED`, `CANCELLED`), `created_at`\\n   - **Database-level constraint**: `UniqueConstraint(\\\"doctor_id\\\", \\\"start_time\\\", name=\\\"uq_doctor_slot_start_time\\\")`.\\n\\n5. **Appointment**:\\n   - `id`, `patient_reference` (indexed), `doctor_id` (FK -> doctors.id)\\n   - `slot_id` (FK -> appointment_slots.id, ON DELETE RESTRICT, **UNIQUE**).\\n   - **Double-booking protection**: The unique constraint on `slot_id` physically prevents any two appointment rows from referencing the same slot.\\n   - `appointment_status`: Server controlled (`CONFIRMED`, `COMPLETED`, `CANCELLED`, `NO_SHOW`).\\n   - `reason_category`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `visit_completed_at`.\\n   - `follow_up_recommended`, `follow_up_date`, `follow_up_notes`.\\n\\n6. **LabOrder**:\\n   - `id`, `patient_reference`, `ordering_department_id` (FK -> departments.id, ON DELETE SET NULL)\\n   - `test_category`, `workflow_status` (`Pending`, `Processing`, `Completed`, `Delayed`)\\n   - `expected_completion_at`, `assigned_team`, `delay_reason`, `created_at`, `updated_at`\\n   - *Strict boundary: Workflow metadata only; does not store or process clinical laboratory results.*\\n\\n7. **WorkflowException**:\\n   - `id`, `exception_type`, `title`, `description`, `priority` (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`, `CRITICAL`)\\n   - `responsible_department`, `assigned_to`, `status` (`OPEN`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `RESOLVED`, `DISMISSED`)\\n   - `affected_record_type`, `affected_record_id`, `detected_at`, `updated_at`, `resolved_at`, `resolution_note`\\n\\n8. **AuditEvent**:\\n   - `id`, `actor_reference`, `action`, `entity_type`, `entity_id`, `details`, `created_at`\\n   - Automatically records booking, cancellations, visit completions, follow-up recommendations, exception detections, assignments, and resolutions.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Booking Reliability & Concurrency Safeguards\\n\\nThe `book_appointment` service implements multi-tier validation:\\n1. **Ownership verification**: Confirms `slot.doctor_id == doctor_id` to prevent cross-physician booking errors.\\n2. **Temporal validity**: Confirms `slot.start_time > now_utc` (past slots are rejected with HTTP 400).\\n3. **Availability check**: Confirms `slot.status == \'AVAILABLE\'` (non-available slots return HTTP 409 Conflict).\\n4. **Row-level concurrency lock**: Utilizes `with_for_update()` in PostgreSQL dialects during slot selection.\\n5. **Database unique constraint**: `uq_appointment_slot_id` ensures that even in race conditions, only one transaction can commit.\\n6. **Atomic commit & rollback**: Slot status transition to `BOOKED`, appointment record creation, and `AuditEvent` insertion occur in a single atomic transaction.\\n7. **Consistent cancellation**: Cancelling an appointment sets status to `CANCELLED` and safely reverts slot status back to `AVAILABLE`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. AI Tool Service Interfaces (Section 9)\\n\\nIn preparation for future voice and agent orchestration, typed Python functions are exposed:\\n\\n### 1. `search_doctors_tool(db, specialty_or_department, hospital_id)`\\n- **Input**: `specialty_or_department` (str), `hospital_id` (optional str)\\n- **Output**: List of dicts `[{\\\"doctor_id\\\", \\\"display_name\\\", \\\"specialty\\\", \\\"department_name\\\", \\\"hospital_id\\\"}]`\\n- **Safety**: Pure query, read-only.\\n\\n### 2. `get_available_slots_tool(db, doctor_id, requested_date, time_range)`\\n- **Input**: `doctor_id` (str), `requested_date` (optional \\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\"), `time_range` (optional \\\"morning\\\"|\\\"afternoon\\\"|\\\"evening\\\")\\n- **Output**: List of dicts `[{\\\"slot_id\\\", \\\"doctor_id\\\", \\\"doctor_name\\\", \\\"start_time\\\", \\\"end_time\\\", \\\"status\\\"}]`\\n- **Safety**: Filters exclusively for `status == \\\"AVAILABLE\\\"`.\\n\\n### 3. `book_appointment_tool(db, patient_reference, doctor_id, selected_slot_id, reason_category)`\\n- **Input**: `patient_reference` (str), `doctor_id` (str), `selected_slot_id` (str), `reason_category` (str)\\n- **Output**: Dict with confirmed booking identifier, physician details, and status.\\n- **Safety**: Client/AI cannot supply status; forced server default `CONFIRMED`. Cannot override doctor-slot ownership or booking constraints.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Setup & Execution Guide\\n\\n### 6.1 Prerequisites\\n- Python 3.10+ (Verified on Python 3.11.2)\\n- PostgreSQL (or local SQLite for zero-daemon testing)\\n\\n### 6.2 Environment Setup\\n```bash\\n# Clone and enter backend directory\\ncd backend\\n\\n# Create virtual environment (optional)\\npython3 -m venv venv\\nsource venv/bin/activate\\n\\n# Install dependencies\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n\\n# Configure environment variables\\ncp .env.example .env\\n```\\n\\n### 6.3 Database Migrations (Alembic)\\nFor PostgreSQL:\\n```bash\\n# Apply migrations to configured database\\nalembic upgrade head\\n```\\n\\n### 6.4 Seeding Synthetic Data\\n```bash\\n# Populate Aarogya One Hospital synthetic records\\npython3 scripts/seed_data.py\\n\\n# Optional: Reset and re-seed from scratch\\npython3 scripts/seed_data.py --reset\\n```\\n\\n### 6.5 Running FastAPI Development Server\\n```bash\\n# Start server on port 8000\\npython3 -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload\\n```\\nInteractive OpenAPI documentation will be accessible at:\\n- **Swagger UI**: `http://localhost:8000/docs`\\n- **ReDoc**: `http://localhost:8000/redoc`\\n\\n### 6.6 Running the Test Suite (Pytest)\\n```bash\\nPYTHONPATH=. pytest tests/ -v\\n```\\nAll 26 tests run against an isolated in-memory SQLite fixture and pass in under 1 second.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Example API Requests & Responses\\n\\n### 7.1 Search Doctors\\n**Request:**\\n```http\\nGET /api/v1/doctors?specialty=Cardiology\\n```\\n**Response (200 OK):**\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"33333333-0001-0000-0000-000000000001\\\",\\n    \\\"hospital_id\\\": \\\"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\\\",\\n    \\\"department_id\\\": \\\"22222222-0001-0000-0000-000000000001\\\",\\n    \\\"display_name\\\": \\\"Dr. Rajesh Sharma\\\",\\n    \\\"specialty\\\": \\\"Cardiology\\\",\\n    \\\"is_active\\\": true,\\n    \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-12T07:55:00Z\\\",\\n    \\\"department_name\\\": \\\"Cardiology\\\",\\n    \\\"hospital_name\\\": \\\"Aarogya One Hospital\\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\n### 7.2 Book Appointment\\n**Request:**\\n```http\\nPOST /api/v1/appointments\\nContent-Type: application/json\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"patient_reference\\\": \\\"PAT-2024-9182\\\",\\n  \\\"doctor_id\\\": \\\"33333333-0001-0000-0000-000000000001\\\",\\n  \\\"slot_id\\\": \\\"slot-uuid-here\\\",\\n  \\\"reason_category\\\": \\\"Chest Pain & Palpitations Evaluation\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n**Response (201 Created):**\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"44444444-0001-0000-0000-000000000001\\\",\\n  \\\"patient_reference\\\": \\\"PAT-2024-9182\\\",\\n  \\\"doctor_id\\\": \\\"33333333-0001-0000-0000-000000000001\\\",\\n  \\\"slot_id\\\": \\\"slot-uuid-here\\\",\\n  \\\"appointment_status\\\": \\\"CONFIRMED\\\",\\n  \\\"reason_category\\\": \\\"Chest Pain & Palpitations Evaluation\\\",\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-12T07:55:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-12T07:55:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"visit_completed_at\\\": null,\\n  \\\"follow_up_recommended\\\": false,\\n  \\\"follow_up_date\\\": null,\\n  \\\"follow_up_notes\\\": null,\\n  \\\"doctor_name\\\": \\\"Dr. Rajesh Sharma\\\",\\n  \\\"doctor_specialty\\\": \\\"Cardiology\\\",\\n  \\\"slot_start_time\\\": \\\"2026-10-13T10:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"slot_end_time\\\": \\\"2026-10-13T10:30:00Z\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 7.3 Double Booking Rejection\\n**Response (409 Conflict):**\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Slot is no longer available (current status: \'BOOKED\').\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Strict Scope Boundary Compliance\\n\\n| Feature / Boundary | Phase 1 Status | Note |\\n|--------------------|----------------|------|\\n| **SQLAlchemy 2.x Schema & Models** | COMPLETED | All 8 models defined with foreign keys and indexes |\\n| **Alembic Migration** | COMPLETED | Migration `0001_initial_schema.py` generated |\\n| **Synthetic Seed Script** | COMPLETED | `scripts/seed_data.py` populates Aarogya One Hospital |\\n| **Doctor & Slot Retrieval Endpoints** | COMPLETED | `/api/v1/doctors`, `/slots` with filters |\\n| **Transaction-Safe Booking** | COMPLETED | Atomic booking, unique constraint, rollback on conflict |\\n| **Controlled Cancellation & Re-release** | COMPLETED | Reverts slot to AVAILABLE, records AuditEvent |\\n| **Follow-up Recommendation** | COMPLETED | Non-clinical operational recommendation, no auto-booking |\\n| **AI Tool Python Interfaces** | COMPLETED | `search_doctors_tool`, `get_available_slots_tool`, `book_appointment_tool` |\\n| **Pytest Suite** | COMPLETED | 26 tests passing (100% test pass rate) |\\n| **Gnani Prisma STT** | EXCLUDED (Phase 2) | No speech recognition calls |\\n| **Timbre TTS** | EXCLUDED (Phase 2) | No speech synthesis calls |\\n| **Evon Reasoning Model** | EXCLUDED (Phase 2) | No external model credit usage |\\n| **Raw SQL AI Access** | EXCLUDED (Forbidden) | Restricted typed tool boundaries only |\\n| **Clinical Records / EMR** | EXCLUDED | Only operational scheduling and workflow metadata |\\n\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/backend/README.md\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating backend README.md\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create backend README documentation\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
