          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 3.1 Entities & Relational Guarantees"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Hospital**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Primary key: `id` (UUID string)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `name`, `description`, `address`, `is_active`, `created_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Pre-seeded with **Aarogya One Hospital** in Bengaluru."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Department**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `hospital_id` (FK -> hospitals.id, ON DELETE CASCADE)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `name`, `description`, `is_active`, `created_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Seeded: Cardiology, Neurology, Orthopedics, Pediatrics, General Medicine."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Doctor**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `hospital_id`, `department_id` (FK -> departments.id)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `display_name`, `specialty`, `is_active`, `created_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Seeded with 6 fictional physicians across departments."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **AppointmentSlot**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `doctor_id` (FK -> doctors.id)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `start_time` (indexed), `end_time`, `status` (`AVAILABLE`, `RESERVED`, `BOOKED`, `CANCELLED`), `created_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Database-level constraint**: `UniqueConstraint(\"doctor_id\", \"start_time\", name=\"uq_doctor_slot_start_time\")`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Appointment**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `patient_reference` (indexed), `doctor_id` (FK -> doctors.id)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `slot_id` (FK -> appointment_slots.id, ON DELETE RESTRICT, **UNIQUE**)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Double-booking protection**: The unique constraint on `slot_id` physically prevents any two appointment rows from referencing the same slot."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `appointment_status`: Server controlled (`CONFIRMED`, `COMPLETED`, `CANCELLED`, `NO_SHOW`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `reason_category`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `visit_completed_at`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `follow_up_recommended`, `follow_up_date`, `follow_up_notes`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "6. **LabOrder**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `patient_reference`, `ordering_department_id` (FK -> departments.id, ON DELETE SET NULL)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `test_category`, `workflow_status` (`Pending`, `Processing`, `Completed`, `Delayed`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `expected_completion_at`, `assigned_team`, `delay_reason`, `created_at`, `updated_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - *Strict boundary: Workflow metadata only; does not store or process clinical laboratory results.*"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "7. **WorkflowException**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `exception_type`, `title`, `description`, `priority` (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`, `CRITICAL`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `responsible_department`, `assigned_to`, `status` (`OPEN`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `RESOLVED`, `DISMISSED`)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `affected_record_type`, `affected_record_id`, `detected_at`, `updated_at`, `resolved_at`, `resolution_note`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "8. **AuditEvent**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `id`, `actor_reference`, `action`, `entity_type`, `entity_id`, `details`, `created_at`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Automatically records booking, cancellations, visit completions, follow-up recommendations, exception detections, assignments, and resolutions."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## 4. Booking Reliability & Concurrency Safeguards"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "The `book_appointment` service implements multi-tier validation:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Ownership verification**: Confirms `slot.doctor_id == doctor_id` to prevent cross-physician booking errors."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Temporal validity**: Confirms `slot.start_time > now_utc` (past slots are rejected with HTTP 400)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Availability check**: Confirms `slot.status == \'AVAILABLE\'` (non-available slots return HTTP 409 Conflict)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Row-level concurrency lock**: Utilizes `with_for_update()` in PostgreSQL dialects during slot selection."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Database unique constraint**: `uq_appointment_slot_id` ensures that even in race conditions, only one transaction can commit."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "6. **Atomic commit & rollback**: Slot status transition to `BOOKED`, appointment record creation, and `AuditEvent` insertion occur in a single atomic transaction."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "7. **Consistent cancellation**: Cancelling an appointment sets status to `CANCELLED` and safely reverts slot status back to `AVAILABLE`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## 5. AI Tool Service Interfaces (Section 9)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "In preparation for future voice and agent orchestration, typed Python functions are exposed:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 1. `search_doctors_tool(db, specialty_or_department, hospital_id)`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Input**: `specialty_or_department` (str), `hospital_id` (optional str)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Output**: List of dicts `[{\"doctor_id\", \"display_name\", \"specialty\", \"department_name\", \"hospital_id\"}]`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Safety**: Pure query, read-only."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 2. `get_available_slots_tool(db, doctor_id, requested_date, time_range)`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Input**: `doctor_id` (str), `requested_date` (optional \"YYYY-MM-DD\"), `time_range` (optional \"morning\"|\"afternoon\"|\"evening\")"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Output**: List of dicts `[{\"slot_id\", \"doctor_id\", \"doctor_name\", \"start_time\", \"end_time\", \"status\"}]`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Safety**: Filters exclusively for `status == \"AVAILABLE\"`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 3. `book_appointment_tool(db, patient_reference, doctor_id, selected_slot_id, reason_category)`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Input**: `patient_reference` (str), `doctor_id` (str), `selected_slot_id` (str), `reason_category` (str)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Output**: Dict with confirmed booking identifier, physician details, and status."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- **Safety**: Client/AI cannot supply status; forced server default `CONFIRMED`. Cannot override doctor-slot ownership or booking constraints."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
